OL,3,GNEWSAStates stalls on plan for housing
OL,4,Adeposit scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey will not have a
OL,7,Fgovernment-regulated deposit scheme for
OL,8,Fprivate home rentals, despite calls
OL,9,Ffrom islanders.
OL,11,FThe Committee for Housing announced in
OL,12,Fits work plan that it had decided "not
OL,13,Fto progress" a planned scheme in the
OL,14,Fhope a "functional solution" could be
OL,15,Fdelivered by the housing industry.
OL,17,FHowever, Guernsey Deposits, an
OL,18,Forganisation set up to provide an
OL,19,Findustry-led scheme, said its solution
OL,20,Fwas "ready to launch" but Guernsey's
OL,21,Fregulatory framework made it
OL,22,F"commercially unviable".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
